### VS Code "REST Client" 확장으로 실행
@host = http://localhost:3000
@uid = 1

GET {{host}}/health

###
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-logs
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{uid}}

{ "exerciseId": 1, "startedAt": "2026-10-02T10:00:00+09:00", "completedAt": "2026-10-02T10:20:00+09:00", "durationCompleted": 20, "intensityAfter": 3 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/health/records
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{uid}}

{ "provider": "HEALTH_CONNECT", "records": [ { "externalId": "w-1", "activityType": "Running", "startedAt": "2026-10-02T10:00:00+09:00", "endedAt": "2026-10-02T10:21:00+09:00", "avgHeartRate": 125, "steps": 2400 } ] }
